Diavgis — public interface artefacts
====================================

The files in this repository (OpenAPI description, OCDS publication metadata,
llms.txt, the agent catalogue and the MCP documentation) are published under

    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribute to "Diavgis" (https://diavgis.gr).

The same licence covers the bulk dataset at
https://huggingface.co/datasets/diavgis/greek-public-procurement

NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE
---------------------------
The Diavgis application source code is not published in this repository and is
not licensed here.

